Third-party components
======================

QEMU (https://gitlab.com/qemu-project/qemu)
  Location: vendor/qemu, a git submodule reference. No QEMU source is
            stored in this repository or included in the published crates.
  License:  GPL-2.0-or-later for the QAPI schema files and their
            documentation comments.
  Use:      qrab-qapi-codegen reads the schemas as input. The checked-in
            generated sources (projects/qapi/src/generated and
            projects/qapi/src/qga) carry names, types and version facts
            needed for the wire protocol and no QEMU schema prose.
            projects/qapi-codegen/qemu-versions.lock lists QEMU release tag
            names and commit IDs. Building qrab-qapi with the opt-in
            `schema-docs` feature copies QEMU's GPL-2.0-or-later schema
            documentation into the build output for local reading; such
            output must not be published or shipped.
